  sense it doesn't have to hold up in  court but there has to be a reason for  everything we don't have to wait long to  find out what they're trying to do they  go to howard's country club jimmy has  signed up for a tour which gets derailed  when kevin wachtel sees him and  complains to the membership director he  makes an excuse about the club having a  two-year waiting list a clear turn from  how he was treating him just a minute  ago and so jimmy breaks into a hilarious  performative tirade about how they're  trying to keep him out because he's  jewish because of his name which of  course jimmy mcgill is not this sets  kevin off he continues to push his  buttons nearly provoking him to violence  and then he takes the opportunity to ask  to use the bathroom because the stress  is hell on his diverticulitis he gets  access to the men's locker room which  was where he was trying to go the whole  time there he clogs one of the toilets  to create a diversion he's able to find  out where howard's locker is kim sees  that they're returning and sends him a  message to abort which he ignores and  that leads to him having to get naked to  pretend he's just getting out of the  shower drying his hair when they come in  the plan was to get a bag of drugs to  fall out of howard's locker when he  opened it so that cliff would see it  howard is as surprised as he is so cliff  isn't really suspicious but it's  something that'll stick in his mind  since there isn't a good explanation for  it either kim who seemed to be  exhilarated by the entire process  especially looking through those  binoculars worries that it might be too  subtle but jimmy assures her that it was  perfect and you do see clip thinking as  howard drives off it was pretty  impressive how jimmy rose to the  occasion in the heat of things  considering everything else that's going  on and it makes you realize just how  good of a team these two make when  they're so inclined lalo is on his way  to the border where 